  values ('ME', 'short_answer', 'State the laws of reflection from a plane mirror. Draw a diagram and label: (a) incident ray; (b) normal; (c) reflected ray; (d) angle of reflection; (e) angle of incidence. (3 marks)', 'Laws of reflection: (1) the angle of incidence is equal to the angle of reflection (∠i = ∠r); (2) the incident ray, the reflected ray and the normal at the point of incidence all lie in the same plane. Diagram: draw a plane mirror as a straight line; at the point of incidence draw a dotted line perpendicular to the mirror (the normal); draw the incident ray coming in towards the point and the reflected ray leaving on the other side of the normal; mark the angle between the incident ray and the normal as the angle of incidence (i) and the angle between the reflected ray and the normal as the angle of reflection (r), with i = r.', null, '[{"point": "Law 1: the angle of incidence equals the angle of reflection (i = r)", "marks": 1}, {"point": "Law 2: the incident ray, reflected ray and normal at the point of incidence all lie in the same plane", "marks": 1}, {"point": "Correct labelled diagram: mirror, normal at point of incidence, incident and reflected rays, angles i and r measured from the normal", "marks": 1}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'general-subject-knowledge'),
